{"tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"charges_2006 + acquisitions_2006 - cash_outlays_2006","variables":{"charges_2006":{"value":4,"source":"source:q12n3","unit":"USD_million"},"acquisitions_2006":{"value":7,"source":"source:q14n0","unit":"USD_million"},"cash_outlays_2006":{"value":5,"source":"source:q13n0","unit":"USD_million"}},"sources":{"charges_2006":"source:q12n3","acquisitions_2006":"source:q14n0","cash_outlays_2006":"source:q13n0"}},"message":"I choose the 2006 warranty reserve rollforward to explain the change: beginning reserve equals the 2005 ending reserve ($4 million), then add 2006 pretax warranty charges ($4 million) and warranty obligations assumed in acquisitions ($7 million), and subtract 2006 cash outlays ($5 million). Net change from 2005 to 2006 = charges + acquisitions - cash outlays = 4 + 7 - 5."}